TEXT 1104 -560 Left 2 !*\n.param Gfc=-20 ; magnitude at crossover *\n.param PS=-140 ; phase lag at crossover *\n*\n* Enter Design Goals Information Here *\n*\n.param fc=1k ; targeted crossover *\n.param PM=70 ; choose phase margin at crossover *\n*\n* Enter the Values for Vout and Bridge Bias Current *\n*\n.param Vout=12\n.param Ibias=250u\n.param Vref=2.5\n.param Rlower={Vref/Ibias}\n.param Rupper={(Vout-Vref)/Ibias}\n.param Rpullup=10k\n.param Vz=5\n.param IZbias=2m\n*\n* Do not edit the below lines *\n*\n* Optocoupler specifications *\n*\n.param Fopto=15k\n.param Copto=1/(2*pi*Fopto*Rpullup)\n.param CTR=0.85\n*\n.param boost=PM-PS-90 \n.param G=10**(-Gfc/20)\n*\n* TL431 bias conditions\n*\n.param VL=2.5\n.param VCEsat=0.3\n.param Vdd=5\n.param Ib=1m\n.param Vf=1\n.param Aa={Vz-Vf-VL}\n.param Bb={Vdd-VCEsat+Ib*CTR*Rpullup}\n.param Rmax={(Aa/Bb)*Rpullup*CTR}\n.param Za={(Vout-Vz)*Rpullup*CTR}\n.param Zb={(Vdd-VCEsat)+(Ib+IZbias)*Rpullup*CTR}\n.param Rz={Za/Zb}\n.param RLED={0.8*Rmax}\n*\n* Capture the double zero position and one of the pole position *\n*\n.param Kf={(tan((boost/4+45)*pi/180))**2}\n.param fz1={fc/sqrt(Kf)}\n.param fz2={fc/sqrt(Kf)}\n.param fp1={fc*sqrt(Kf)}\n.param fp2={fc*sqrt(Kf)}\n*\n.param G1={Rpullup*CTR/RLED}\n.param G2={Rupper*G/G1}\n*\n.param a={sqrt((fc**2/fp1**2)+1)}\n.param b={sqrt((fc**2/fp2**2)+1)}\n.param c={sqrt((fz1**2/fc**2)+1)}\n.param d={sqrt((fc**2/fz2**2)+1)}\n*\n.param R2={(a*b/(c*d))*G2}\n.param C1={1/(2*pi*fz1*R2)}\n.param C2={1/(2*pi*fp1*Rpullup)}\n.param C3={(fp2-fz2)/(2*pi*Rupper*fp2*fz2)}\n.param R3={Rupper*fz2/(fp2-fz2)}\n.param Ccol={C2-Copto}\n*\n*
TEXT 616 -440 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 10 100k
TEXT -56 432 Left 2 ;Type 3 compensator\nTL431 + optocoupler\nK-factor type for pole-zero placement\nChristophe Basso
TEXT 128 1088 Left 2 ;The dc labels are the values of the components:\npV --> pF\nnV --> nF\nkV --> kOhms
TEXT 456 448 Left 2 !.model DZen D(Vrev={Vz})
